Precondition: tests run in a controlled test environment with simulated robots, chamber sensors, and railway signals where appropriate.
Test ID	Steps / Input	Expected result	CR retest
TC-01	Power on a robot.	Robot enters IDLE and records initialization.	None
TC-02	Submit a valid delivery request while IDLE.	Request is validated and the robot enters NAVIGATING.	None
